# Cloudflare Pages redirects: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
# Each line is `<old path> <new path> 301`. These keep the URLs of the old
# GitBook site working. scripts/check-redirects.mjs checks every URL in its
# sitemap (scripts/gitbook-sitemap.xml) against the build output.
#
# Redirects apply even when a page exists at the old path, so never redirect a
# path that's a live page. /guide/message-attributes/attributes is one: it was
# the correlation id page, and is now the attributes page.

